                <head>No. 122.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hoffman to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-05-03"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 3,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Winslow applied for discharge. Attorney-general opposed. Case adjourned ten
                    days.</p>
                <closer><signed>HOFFMAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
